loyees from providing abortion services, affecting facilities that currently receive federal funds."},{"industry":"ideological-single-issue","confidence":0.75,"rationale":"Organizations focused on reproductive health policy and abortion access or restrictions have a direct stake in the regulatory framework this bill establishes."}],"plainSummary":"This bill would make permanent the restrictions on federal funding for abortion services and health insurance coverage that includes abortion. Currently, these restrictions are renewed each year through appropriations bills; the bill would apply them across all federal programs and funds. It would also prohibit qualified health plans offered through insurance marketplaces from covering abortion. The bill includes exceptions for cases of rape, incest, or when the pregnant person's life is in danger.","classificationMethod":"llm","plain":{"whoItTouches":"Anyone who buys health insurance. Anyone who pays a medical bill.","confidence":"crs-summary"},"topOverlap":{"bioguideId":"B001260","score":0.061260165720508956},"overlapCount":107},"meaning":{"percentile":87.49012794187333,"median":0.010636331736930488,"n":6331,"ordinary":[{"kind":"state-industry","text":"Health Providers is also the top donor sector for 6 other members from FL. That points to the industry being big in the state, not to anything about this member."}],"unattributedShare":0.6334354251558496}},{"billId":"119-hr-685","bioguideId":"C001039","cycle":2026,"score":0.03142142743261979,"matches":[{"industry":"health-providers","donorAmount":82750,"donorShare":0.057566261392997926,"billConfidence":0.85,"contribution":0.0271840678800268},{"industry":"pharma","donorAmount":11541.02,"donorShare":0.008028681257544615,"billConfidence":0.95,"contribution":0.004237359552592992}],"method":{"formula":"score = Σ_industries ( donorShare(industry) × billWeight(industry) ), where billWeight = classifierConfidence / Σ classifierConfidence. Range 0–1, read as a weighted share of dis